---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const title = "Pricing \u2014 Transparent fixed fees | Lodgedwell";
const description = "Fixed-fee conveyancing for Victoria. One transparent fee including disbursements, so you know exactly what it is going to cost.";
---
<Base title={title} description={description} active="pricing" tally={false}>
<main>
<section class="page-hero center">
  <span class="blob blob-1"></span>
  <span class="blob blob-2"></span>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head center reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Pricing</span>
      <h1>Fixed fees. No fine-print surprises.</h1>
      <p class="lead">One transparent fee, including disbursements*, so you know exactly what it is going to cost.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:18px;font-size:.86rem;color:var(--muted)">*Owners Corporation certificates are additional. Excludes PEXA fees and government charges, including stamp duty.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- PRICE TIERS -->
<section class="section" style="padding-top:16px">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="price-grid">
      <div class="price-card reveal">
        <span class="price-name">Sale</span>
        <p class="price-desc">Selling a Victorian home or investment property.</p>
        <div class="price-amount"><span class="cur">$</span><span class="num">1,000</span><span class="per">+ GST</span></div>
        <p class="price-note">Disbursements included*</p>
        <ul class="check-list">
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Section 32 vendor statement</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Contract of sale prepared</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>PEXA settlement managed</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/get-started#sell" class="btn btn--ghost btn--block">Start selling</a>
      </div>
      <div class="price-card featured reveal" data-delay="1">
        <span class="price-name">Purchase</span>
        <p class="price-desc">Buying your next home or investment in VIC.</p>
        <div class="price-amount"><span class="cur">$</span><span class="num">1,000</span><span class="per">+ GST</span></div>
        <p class="price-note">Disbursements included*</p>
        <ul class="check-list">
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Expert examination of your matter</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Stamp duty &amp; concessions</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>PEXA settlement &amp; title transfer</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/get-started#buy" class="btn btn--block">Start buying</a>
      </div>
      <div class="price-card reveal" data-delay="2">
        <span class="price-name">Transfer</span>
        <p class="price-desc">Adding, removing or gifting a name on title.</p>
        <div class="price-amount"><span class="cur">$</span><span class="num">1,000</span><span class="per">+ GST</span></div>
        <p class="price-note">Disbursements included*</p>
        <ul class="check-list">
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Related-party transfers</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Duty &amp; exemption checks</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Title lodgement handled</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/get-started" class="btn btn--ghost btn--block">Enquire now</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="center" style="margin-top:26px;font-size:.86rem;color:var(--muted);max-width:640px;margin-inline:auto">*Owners Corporation certificates are additional. Excludes PEXA fees and government charges, including stamp duty.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- WHAT'S A DISBURSEMENT -->
<section class="section" style="background:var(--cream-200);border-block:1px solid var(--line)">
  <div class="container split">
    <div class="split-copy reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Total transparency</span>
      <h2>One fee, two simple payments</h2>
      <p class="lead">Your fixed fee covers our professional work and the standard disbursements. Here's exactly what it includes and when you pay.</p>
      <div style="margin-top:26px">
        <div class="info-row"><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2v20M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"/></svg></span><div><h4>One fixed fee — $1,000 + GST</h4><p>Covers our professional work end-to-end and the standard disbursements — title searches, and council and water certificates. Quoted up front and it doesn't change.</p></div></div>
        <div class="info-row"><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M3 10h18M8 15h4"/></svg></span><div><h4>$330 on engagement</h4><p>An engagement fee of $330 including GST is payable when you engage us. It covers any costs incurred if your matter doesn't proceed. The balance is only payable at settlement.</p></div></div>
        <div class="info-row"><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><path d="M7 14l3-3 3 3 5-5"/></svg></span><div><h4>What's not included</h4><p>Owners Corporation certificates (where needed), PEXA fees, and government charges — including stamp duty, which buyers pay to the State Revenue Office, not to us.</p></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="split-media reveal" data-delay="1">
      <div class="card" style="padding:30px">
        <h3 style="margin-bottom:6px">How your bill works</h3>
        <p style="font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:18px">Every matter, no surprises</p>
        <div style="display:grid;gap:2px">
          <div class="mock-row" style="padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)"><span>Fixed fee, disbursements included</span><b>$1,000 + GST</b></div>
          <div class="mock-row" style="padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)"><span>Payable on engagement</span><b style="color:var(--muted);font-weight:600">$330 incl. GST</b></div>
          <div class="mock-row" style="padding:14px 0"><span>Balance payable at settlement</span><b style="color:var(--muted);font-weight:600">$770 incl. GST</b></div>
        </div>
        <a href="/get-started" class="btn btn--block" style="margin-top:22px">Get started</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- PRICING FAQ -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head center reveal" style="margin-bottom:44px">
      <span class="eyebrow">Pricing questions</span>
      <h2>The fine print, in plain English</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="faq">
      <div class="faq-item reveal">
        <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">Is the fixed fee really fixed?<span class="plus"></span></button>
        <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner"><p>Yes. Our professional fee is agreed in writing before we start and won't change for a standard matter. If something genuinely unusual comes up, we'll talk to you and agree any change before doing the work — never after.</p></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item reveal">
        <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">What are disbursements?<span class="plus"></span></button>
        <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner"><p>Disbursements are third-party costs we pay on your behalf — things like title searches, council and water certificates. These are included in your fee already. What's not included is the cost of any Owners Corporation certificates needed, PEXA and government fees.</p></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item reveal">
        <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">When do I pay?<span class="plus"></span></button>
        <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner"><p>We charge an engagement fee of $330 including GST upon engagement, to cover any costs incurred in the event that your matter does not proceed. The balance is only payable at settlement.</p></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA -->
<section class="cta-band section-sm">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-inner reveal">
      <h2>Ready to get started?</h2>
      <p>Start online in minutes, and a licensed conveyancer will be in touch within one business day.</p>
      <div class="cta-actions">
        <a href="/get-started#buy" class="btn btn--coral btn--lg">I'm buying</a>
        <a href="/get-started#sell" class="btn btn--ghost btn--lg">I'm selling</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</main>
</Base>
